cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release below."
title: "SDE-Cast"
abstract: >-
  Inference code and released checkpoints for SDE-Cast, a weather forecasting
  model that learns a stochastic differential equation directly on weather
  states. Because the learnt drift and diffusion are defined continuously in
  time, forecasts can be produced at arbitrary temporal resolution without
  retraining, and ensembles arise from repeated SDE sampling rather than a
  separate perturbation scheme. Trained with SDE Matching, a simulation-free
  algorithm for neural SDEs. Evaluated on ERA5 reanalysis and on surface
  quasi-geostrophic turbulence, where the true dynamics are known.
